93	     * exceed one above the current maximum membershipLevel among their household members. With no
94	     * existing household member no cap applies.
95	     *
96	     * <p>The ceiling depends on other owners, so — like the household size — it is not derived here: the
97	     * maximum level among other household members is computed by
98	     * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.function.owner.OwnerHousehold} before the owner
99	     * reaches this mapper and read from {@link Owner#getHouseholdMaxMembershipLevel()} (null when no
100	     * other member exists), keeping this a pure transformation.
101	     */
102	    default int membershipLevel(Owner owner) {
103	        int level = rawMembershipLevel(owner);
104	        Integer householdMax = owner.getHouseholdMaxMembershipLevel();
105	        if (householdMax != null && level > householdMax + 1) {
